@startuml
title Neutral graph core and portable boundary ownership
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam component {
  BorderColor #1E3A5F
  FontColor #0F172A
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #7C2D12
  FontColor #431407
}

component "Domain adapter\nstable labels + meaning" as domain #FCE7F3
component "libvgraph\npayload-free canonical CSR\nSCC · quotient · wavefront" as core #DBEAFE
component "libvgraph-interop\nschema · codec · limits\nprofile binding · digest" as interop #D1FAE5
database "Portable bytes\nor content-addressed cache" as store #FEF3C7
component "Independent validator\nexact profile + expected digest" as validator #EDE9FE

domain -right-> core : canonical dense graph
core -right-> interop : forward offsets + targets
interop -right-> store : v1.0 bytes + digest
store -down-> validator : untrusted candidate
validator -left-> core : validated dense graph

note bottom of core #E0F2FE
No serialization, hashing, libcpg,
parser, e-graph, or domain semantics.
end note

note bottom of interop #DCFCE7
Request-local mutable state.
Immutable values are shareable.
No global lock or input-depth recursion.
end note
@enduml
